<p class="lede">I’m Allen Hansen, a senior full-stack engineer.</p>
<p>
  For {yearsInWords} years I’ve made web apps faster, more accessible, and easier
  to change: Web Forms to React and Angular, WCAG 2.1 AA, theming and design systems.
  Lately it’s Python, FastAPI, and AI tooling.
</p>
<p>
  I’m originally from Michigan. In college, my friends in architecture and
  mechanical engineering designed buildings and other things made to hold up
  under real loads, and I found the same kind of work in software, built from
  code instead of steel. At the University of Minnesota I switched from
  Management Information Systems to computer science, and co-founded <Anchor
    href="https://www.socialcoding.net/"
    >Social Coding<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></Anchor
  >.
</p>
