<p>
  What I enjoy most is taking an idea all the way to the people who use it: a
  polished, accessible experience, with AI layered on top so they get things
  done faster. For years that meant rebuilding large, older apps as smaller
  services with careful attention to how they feel to use. Now I build AI
  features into Resource Advisor+ at Schneider Electric. AI has changed how
  software gets built, and I’m working to keep the craft alive while using it.
</p>
